      "note": "Flags :role and :status as mass-assignable. Both are the point of the endpoint: doc 05 §6 puts staff onboarding behind the Owner, who chooses whether a new hire is a therapist or a manager. StaffController#create and #update each call require_owner! as their first statement, and require_role! raises Forbidden unless current_user.role is exactly 'owner' — Brakeman cannot see that guard, so it assumes the params reach an unauthenticated caller. An Owner promoting someone to owner is intended, not escalation: owner is already the top role. If this endpoint ever loses require_owner!, delete this entry rather than re-fingerprint it."
